# S1-DO-01 (.github/workflows/ci.yml `images` job): exceptions to the container image CVE
# gate. Keep this list narrow, dated, and tied to a specific CVE ID - it is a security
# exception log, not a place to silence findings quietly. Any CVE not listed here still
# fails the build.
#
# CVE-2026-49451 (Microsoft.OpenApi 2.0.0, GHSA-v5pm-xwqc-g5wc): the SAME advisory already
# carved out in the `backend` job's NuGet vulnerability scan step (NU1903 at restore time).
# It reappears here because the API image's published deps.json still lists the package -
# this is the identical known Phase 0 finding surfacing through a second tool, not a new one.
# Remove this line once Microsoft.OpenApi ships a fixed 2.x release, or CMPlus.WebApi moves
# off the vulnerable transitive dependency.
CVE-2026-49451
